/T (I am a Mechanical Engineering student at Arizona State University with interests in robotics, mechanical design, manufacturing, and product development. I enjoy transforming ideas into functional systems through CAD, fabrication, electrical integration, and hands-on prototyping. Through robotics and engineering projects, I have developed experience in multidisciplinary collaboration, manufacturing, and technical problem-solving. As I continue my engineering education, I look forward to expanding my skills through challenging coursework, personal projects, and industry experience while contributing to innovative engineering teams.)
